    "body": "Unfortunately, I think this is outside of what starship can accomplish. For the most part, we can't even read what command is being run, much less what output that command generates (which is the bare minimum needed to detect URL/URIs).\r\n\r\nThis may be possible in other terminal emulators though. For example, in Konsole, there's a toggleable setting that lets you click URLs (you can even number them so that e.g. ALT+4 opens the 4th URL on the screen).\r\n",
